   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Center for Transitional Justice (ICTJ) is an expert organisation for transitional justice processes. Their focus is on countries affected by violent conflict or gone through a crisis. Sida supports ICTJ with a core grant to implement theri work in more than 15 countries and to be a global expert organisation.</narrative>
